{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":95,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Come, let us sing for joy to Jehovah; Let us make a joyful noise to the rock of our salvation.","tok":[{"t":"Come","s":["H3212"]},{"t":", let us "},{"t":"sing","s":["H7442"],"a":[1]},{"t":" for joy to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; Let us make a joyful "},{"t":"noise","s":["H7321"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"rock","s":["H6697"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of our "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3468"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Let us come before His presence with thanksgiving; Let us make a joyful noise to Him with psalms.","tok":[{"t":"Let us "},{"t":"come","s":["H6923"],"a":[0]},{"t":" before His "},{"t":"presence","s":["H6440"],"a":[1]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"thanksgiving","s":["H8426"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; Let us make a joyful "},{"t":"noise","s":["H7321"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to Him with "},{"t":"psalms","s":["H2158"],"a":[3]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"For Jehovah is a great God And a great King above all gods.","tok":[{"t":"For "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is a "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0410"],"a":[1]},{"t":" And a "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"King","s":["H4428"],"a":[4]},{"t":" above all "},{"t":"gods","s":["H0430"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"In His hand are the depths of the earth; The heights of the mountains are His also.","tok":[{"t":"In His "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are the depths of the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; The heights of the mountains are His also."}]},{"n":5,"text":"The sea is His, and He made it; And His hands formed the dry land.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is His, and He "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[4]},{"t":" it; And His "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"formed","s":["H3335"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"dry","s":["H3006"],"a":[5]},{"t":" land."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Come, let us worship and bow dow